# !package-lock.json

# ── Notes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What TO INCLUDE (not ignored):
# - Source code (*.py, *.ts, *.tsx, *.js, *.jsx)
# - Configuration files (*.json, *.yaml, *.toml, *.md)
# - Requirements files (requirements.txt, package.json)
# - Documentation (*.md, README)
# - Static assets (*.svg in public/)
# - Scripts (*.ps1, *.sh)
# - Git config (.gitignore, .gitattributes)

# What to EXCLUDE (ignored):
# - Large video files (download separately)
# - AI model weights (download from official sources)
# - Personal training photos
# - Runtime logs and databases
# - Build artifacts
# - Dependencies (node_modules, .venv)
